abstract: >-
  Paper, numerical checks and a Lean 4 formalisation concerning the p-adic valuations of
  Romik's sequence d(n), the Taylor coefficients of the Jacobi theta constant theta_3 at
  tau = i, at primes p = 3 (mod 4).
